        "login": "michaelzhang-ai"
      }
    },
    {
      "body": "Closing this. The premise was wrong: this is not an image with an older aiter, it is an aiter module that was removed in ROCm/aiter#4919 on 2026-09-18, so skipping the test would hide a real runtime failure in `aiter_sparse_decode_fwd`.\n\nFiled #43765 with the detail.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-12T04:47:32Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/43257#issuecomment-6117933946",
